			(property "Description" "Compact SMT hard power switch replacing JS102011SAQN. Pin2 common; pin1 ON; pin3 unused. Body6.6x2.75mm, nominal1.2mm profile; reserve1.4mm above PCB per front view plus actuator travel. Manufacturer rev1.0 p2 land pattern; model is a simplified envelope including full actuator sweep and locating pegs. Charge with SW1 OFF."
